  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>灵魂字体</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">得益于这款以广受欢迎的《黑暗之魂》系列为灵感、具有哥特与中世纪风格的字体，您的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升，且该字体易于阅读。本字体最初专为 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包制作，现已面向公众开放！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基于 Manfred Klein 创作的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252foptimus-princeps-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optimus Princeps 字体</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字体采用免费字体许可证授权。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/210/souls-font-characaters.PNG\" width=\"645\" height=\"734\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截图（来自 DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/209/2023-12-18_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今日即可购买服务器，与好友一同畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅 &amp; 使用优惠码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:symbol;font-size:24px\">黑暗将至……</span></p>",
